      "correct": 1,
      "explanation": "A woman says byłam (I was); a man says byłem.",
      "optionNotes": [
        "A man's form.",
        null,
        "Była is \"she was\", not \"I was\".",
        "Present tense; wczoraj needs the past."
      ]
